title: "DSLO v0.7 — Semantic Substrate Specification"

message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."

type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: Slowicki
    given-names: Donald
    affiliation: "Inda Moment Incorporated"

abstract: >
  DSLO v0.7 is the canonical public-layer release of the Semantic Substrate
  Specification. It expands the unified geometry governing meaning invariants,
  operator legality, drift dynamics, synthetic-pressure fields, institutional
  deformation, restorative-deficit dynamics, legality invariants, context-window
  geometry, simulation geometry, and the DSUP runtime manifold. This citation
  file provides structured metadata for scientific indexing and cross-surface
  archival stability.

version: "0.7"

